{"title":"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The real value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/6/696167aeaffaf683c282049d633360ae4b9b27eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64^{x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" /> divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca591548448b794ea79a3054c89207caa93e0a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"32\" height=\"15\" /> equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f76a18b37f9747bf9484d388359f961c37e9076.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$256^{2x}$\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/e/3de675cfeed51cddcb226fcfc092ef3c8b237620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } -\\frac{2}{3}\\quad\\text{(B) } -\\frac{1}{3}\\quad\\text{(C) } 0\\quad\\text{(D) } \\frac{1}{4}\\quad\\text{(E) } \\frac{3}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"323\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/7/1f7b840cfbca9314a77d2dca3ab05e6dc464fba0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64=4^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/d/b6d783e440b67500dde05cd5ce658080a4c3861b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$256=4^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"17\" />, we can change all of the numbers in the equation to exponents with base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and solve the equation:\n\\begin{align*}\n\\frac{64^{x-1}}{4^{x-1}}=256^{2x} \\\\\n\\frac{(4^3)^{x-1}}{4^{x-1}}=(4^4)^{2x} \\\\\n\\frac{4^{3x-3}}{4^{x-1}}=4^{8x} \\\\\n4^{2x-2}=4^{8x} \\\\\n2x-2=8x \\\\\nx-1=4x \\\\ \n3x=-1 \\\\\nx=\\frac{-1}{3} \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n</p><p>Thus, our desired answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/b/bdbd38057bec2267a1efc635cd56b7f415daac06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{(B) -1/3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"74\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME\" title=\"1968 AHSME\">1968 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1968 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1968\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_